        "recommendations": "Hearing first M-ETIT-100512 - Light and Display Engineering lecture is beneficial.\nM.Sc. Electrical Engineering and Information Technology 2025 (Master of Science)\n12 MODULES Module: Lighting Design - Theory and Applications [M-ETIT-100577]",
