        "competenceGoal": "The students choose a topic from the field of humanoid robotics, e.g. robot design, motion generation, perception or\nlearning. They conduct a literature research on this topic under the guidance of a scientific supervisor. At the end of the\nsemester, they present the results and write a term paper in English in the form of a scientific publication.\nStudents are familiar with the DFG Code of Conduct \"Guidelines for Safeguarding Good Scientific Practice\" and\nsuccessfully apply these guidelines in the preparation of their scientific work.",
