        "competenceGoal": "The student\n- is able to develop a language translation system using state-of-the-art methods.\n- can evaluate language translation systems.\n- can present his/her findings in a scientific lecture.",
        "content": "The use of deep learning technologies has significantly improved the quality of machine translation of text and speech in\nrecent years. In this internship, students will develop a language translation system for a new language pair using state-\nof-the-art methods.\nIn the first part of the internship, students are introduced step-by-step to the development of a translation system and its\nevaluation. To this end, the various subtasks must be solved. In the second part of the internship, the students are asked\nto independently analyse various improvements to the system.",
