        "content": "This seminar covers the technical as well as ethical aspects of critical issues in AI. Topics covered include bias in\nmachine learning methods, ethically and socially critical applications of AI, and the impact of AI on society. The exact\ntopics will be determined in each semester.\nStudents will work independently on an advanced topic and critically engage with it, presenting and discussing their\nfindings in a lecture and summarizing them in a seminar paper.",
