        "content": "•\n•\n•\n•\n•\nMetal and insulators: Band structure, Fermi surface\nElectronic and heat transport - scattering mechanisms\nPhase transitions: Landau theory, critical exponents\nAtomic magnetism and magnetic interactions\nMagnetic structures, dynamics\nAdditional Information\nThe course will be given in English. Questions and discussions in German are welcome as well.",
