        "prerequisites": "The following conditions have to be fulfilled:\n1.\nThe module M-PHYS-106725 - Macroscopic Quantum Coherence and Dissipation, without Exercises must not have\n2.\nbeen started.\nThe module M-PHYS-106726 - Macroscopic Quantum Coherence and Dissipation, with Exercises (Minor) must not\nhave been started.",
        "modeledPrerequisites": "The following conditions have to be fulfilled:\n1.\nThe module M-PHYS-106725 - Macroscopic Quantum Coherence and Dissipation, without Exercises must not have\n2.\nbeen started.\nThe module M-PHYS-106726 - Macroscopic Quantum Coherence and Dissipation, with Exercises (Minor) must not\nhave been started.",
        "exclusions": [],
        "requires": [],
