        "examType": "The course credit is achieved through successful participation in the exercises. The details will be announced in the first\nlecture or at the first tutorial.\nModeled Prerequisites\nThe following conditions have to be fulfilled:\n1.\nThe module M-PHYS-105535 - Mathematical Methods of Theoretical Physics must not have been started.",
