        "examType": "Oral examination. As part of the major subject of the MSc Physics, the module is examined together with other modules\ntaken. The duration of the oral examination is approx. 60 minutes.\nModeled Prerequisites\nThe following conditions have to be fulfilled:\n1.\nThe module M-PHYS-106849 - Supersymmetry and Exotics at Colliders, with Exercises (Minor) must not have been\n2.\nstarted.\nThe module M-PHYS-106850 - Supersymmetry and Exotics at Colliders, without Exercises must not have been\nstarted.",
        "prerequisites": "The following conditions have to be fulfilled:\n1.\nThe module M-PHYS-106849 - Supersymmetry and Exotics at Colliders, with Exercises (Minor) must not have been\n2.\nstarted.\nThe module M-PHYS-106850 - Supersymmetry and Exotics at Colliders, without Exercises must not have been\nstarted.",
        "modeledPrerequisites": "The following conditions have to be fulfilled:\n1.\nThe module M-PHYS-106849 - Supersymmetry and Exotics at Colliders, with Exercises (Minor) must not have been\n2.\nstarted.\nThe module M-PHYS-106850 - Supersymmetry and Exotics at Colliders, without Exercises must not have been\nstarted.",
        "exclusions": [],
