        "modeledPrerequisites": "The following conditions have to be fulfilled:\n1.\n2.\nThe module M-PHYS-106483 - Surface Science, without Exercises must not have been started.\nThe module M-PHYS-106484 - Surface Science, with Exercises (Minor) must not have been started.",
        "exclusions": [],
